# EDA Report – Superstore Sales Dataset

## Dataset Overview
- Total Records: 9994
- Total Columns: 21

## Data Cleaning
- No missing values found.
- No duplicate rows found.
- Converted Order Date and Ship Date to datetime format.
- Data validation completed successfully.

## KPIs
- Total Sales
- Total Profit
- Total Orders
- Total Customers
- Total Products
- Total Quantity Sold
- Average Sales
- Average Profit

## Visualizations
- Sales by Category
- Sales by Region
- Profit by Category
- Monthly Sales Trend
- Top 10 Products by Sales

## Key Business Insights
1. Technology category generated the highest sales.
2. Some orders resulted in negative profit (loss-making transactions).
3. Sales showed fluctuations across different months.
4. A few products contributed significantly to total sales.
5. No missing or duplicate records were found.

Statistical Analysis

• Mean, Median and Mode calculated.
• Standard Deviation measured for Sales and Profit.
• Correlation analysis performed on Sales, Profit, Quantity and Discount.
• Probability of profitable orders calculated.
• Basic Linear Regression demonstrated using Discount to predict Profit.